---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import FinalCta from '../components/home/FinalCta.astro';
import site from '@content/site.json';
---

<MainLayout
  title="About Talkera Desk | Managed AI Receptionist"
  description="Talkera Desk is a managed AI receptionist service from DRUVA GROUP, an India-based sole proprietorship owned by Ayush Raj. It serves home service and restoration businesses."
  canonicalUrl="https://www.talkeradesk.com/about"
>
  <div class="py-16 lg:py-24 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      <!-- Page Header -->
      <div class="max-w-3xl mb-14">
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold text-ink-deep tracking-tight mb-4">
          A small team that runs your phones.<br />Here is who we are.
        </h1>
        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate leading-relaxed">
          We built Talkera Desk because trade and restoration business owners are losing thousands of dollars every week to unanswered calls, while existing answering solutions either cost thousands a month or require days of frustrating software configuration.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Founder & Team Block (Double-Bezel Mercury Container) -->
      <div class="mercury-shell-light my-16">
        <div class="mercury-inner bg-paper border border-sky-blue p-8 sm:p-12">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-stretch">
            
            <!-- Left Column: Founder Portrait & Identity (stretches full height) -->
            <div class="lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col justify-between h-full">
              <div>
                <img
                  src="/images/ayush-raj.jpg"
                  alt="Ayush Raj - Founder & Lead Engineer, DRUVA GROUP"
                  class="w-44 h-44 sm:w-52 sm:h-52 rounded-3xl object-cover object-top shadow-md mb-5 border-2 border-white ring-2 ring-deep-green/20"
                  loading="lazy"
                />
                <h2 class="font-heading font-extrabold text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-ink-deep tracking-tight">Ayush Raj</h2>
                <div class="text-xs font-sans text-brand-green font-bold mt-1">Proprietor & Lead Engineer</div>
                <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate mt-4 leading-relaxed">
                  Based in India, Ayush leads engineering, systems integration, and voice model calibration for DRUVA GROUP from our operational base in Kolkata.
                </p>
              </div>

              <!-- Contact & Direct Details (Pinned to bottom) -->
              <div class="pt-6 border-t border-sky-blue/70 mt-8 font-sans text-xs text-slate space-y-1.5">
                <div>Contact: <a href={`mailto:${site.supportEmail}`} class="text-deep-green underline font-semibold">{site.supportEmail}</a></div>
                <div>WhatsApp: <span class="font-semibold text-ink">{site.whatsappFormatted}</span></div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Right Column: Editorial Transparency & Registered Base (stretches full height) -->
            <div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col justify-between h-full space-y-6">
              <div>
                <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-deep-green/10 text-deep-green text-xs font-sans font-bold mb-3">
                  Direct Engineering & Physical Roots
                </div>
                <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-ink-deep tracking-tight leading-snug mb-4">
                  Why we do not pretend to be a Silicon Valley office
                </h3>
                <div class="space-y-4 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate leading-relaxed">
                  <p>
                    Many AI voice companies set up Delaware shell addresses while outsourcing their configuration to unvetted contractors. We do the exact opposite: we state our identity, our Indian registration, and our physical roots clearly on every page.
                  </p>
                  <p>
                    When you partner with Talkera Desk, you work directly with the team that builds your call setup and reviews calls. We answer calls 24/7 for businesses in the US, UK, Canada, Australia, and India. Pay As You Go starts at $0.59 a minute, with a $95 monthly minimum.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- Operational Base & Verification Banner (Bottom aligned flush with left column contact block) -->
              <div class="pt-6 border-t border-sky-blue/70">
                <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-white border border-sky-blue shadow-2xs font-sans text-xs">
                  <span class="text-gray-400 block text-[10px] uppercase font-bold tracking-wider mb-1">Operational Base (Udyam Registered)</span>
                  <div class="text-ink-deep font-medium text-[11px] leading-relaxed">
                    {site.teamLocations}
                  </div>
                  <div class="mt-2.5 pt-2 border-t border-gray-100 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 text-[11px]">
                    <a href={site.udyamVerificationUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-deep-green underline font-semibold">
                      Verify Udyam ({site.udyamNumber}) &rarr;
                    </a>
                    <span class="text-gray-300">&bull;</span>
                    <a href={site.gstVerificationUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-deep-green underline font-semibold">
                      Verify GSTIN ({site.gstin}) &rarr;
                    </a>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Legal & Registration Details Table (Spec B1 & B6) -->
      <div class="my-20">
        <div class="max-w-2xl mb-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold font-heading text-ink-deep">
            Registration & Entity Verification
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate mt-1">
            Every business fact published below matches our official government filings.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Mobile horizontal scroll hint -->
        <div class="sm:hidden flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] font-sans text-slate bg-paper px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg border border-sky-blue/60 mb-2">
          <span>Scroll horizontally to view entity records &rarr;</span>
          <span class="text-deep-green font-bold">&bull; Swipe</span>
        </div>

        <div class="table-responsive-wrapper border border-sky-blue rounded-2xl bg-white shadow-tactile font-sans text-xs">
          <table class="w-full min-w-[560px] divide-y divide-sky-blue/60">
            <tbody class="divide-y divide-gray-100 text-slate">
              <tr class="hover:bg-light-blue/20">
                <td class="py-3.5 px-6 font-bold text-ink-deep w-1/3 min-w-[180px]">Brand Name</td>
                <td class="py-3.5 px-6 font-bold text-deep-green">Talkera Desk (talkeradesk.com)</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="hover:bg-light-blue/20">
                <td class="py-3.5 px-6 font-bold text-ink-deep">Legal Entity Name</td>
                <td class="py-3.5 px-6">{site.enterpriseName}</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="hover:bg-light-blue/20">
                <td class="py-3.5 px-6 font-bold text-ink-deep">Legal Form</td>
                <td class="py-3.5 px-6">Sole proprietorship. Proprietor: {site.proprietor}</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="hover:bg-light-blue/20">
                <td class="py-3.5 px-6 font-bold text-ink-deep">Udyam Registration Number</td>
                <td class="py-3.5 px-6">
                  <span class="font-bold text-ink">{site.udyamNumber}</span>
                  <span class="text-slate ml-2">(Micro enterprise, Services &bull; <a href={site.udyamVerificationUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-deep-green underline font-medium">Verify at Portal &rarr;</a>)</span>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="hover:bg-light-blue/20">
                <td class="py-3.5 px-6 font-bold text-ink-deep">Active Issued GSTIN</td>
                <td class="py-3.5 px-6 font-bold text-emerald-700">
                  <span class="font-sans whitespace-nowrap">{site.gstin}</span>
                  <a href={site.gstVerificationUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-deep-green underline font-normal text-xs ml-3 whitespace-nowrap">Verify at GST Portal &rarr;</a>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="hover:bg-light-blue/20">
                <td class="py-3.5 px-6 font-bold text-ink-deep">Date Business Commenced</td>
                <td class="py-3.5 px-6">{site.businessCommencedDate} (DRUVA GROUP official date)</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="hover:bg-light-blue/20">
                <td class="py-3.5 px-6 font-bold text-ink-deep">Talkera Desk Launch Date</td>
                <td class="py-3.5 px-6">{site.talkeraLaunchDate}</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="hover:bg-light-blue/20">
                <td class="py-3.5 px-6 font-bold text-ink-deep">Registered Office Address</td>
                <td class="py-3.5 px-6 font-sans text-xs">{site.registeredAddress}</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="hover:bg-light-blue/20">
                <td class="py-3.5 px-6 font-bold text-ink-deep">Operational Base</td>
                <td class="py-3.5 px-6 font-sans text-xs">{site.teamLocations}</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Where We Are Heading: Pvt Ltd Transition Note (Spec C7) -->
      <div class="my-16 p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-panel bg-paper border border-sky-blue">
        <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-xl text-ink-deep mb-2">Where we are heading: Private Limited Transition</h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate leading-relaxed">
          Talkera Desk operates today as a brand of DRUVA GROUP, a sole proprietorship. As our international client base grows, we plan to transfer operations into an Indian private limited company. When we execute this corporate transition, all clients will receive at least 30 days advance written notice with registration details. All active agreements, pricing, number setups, and data rights transfer smoothly with zero interruption and zero cost. If any client prefers not to continue under the company entity, we provide a full prorated refund of any unused days.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- What We Promise vs What We Do Not Do -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 my-16">
        <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-light-blue/40 border border-sky-blue">
          <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-lg text-deep-green mb-3">&check; What We Promise</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate">
            <li>&bull; All prices and fees published in plain sight.</li>
            <li>&bull; Month-to-month billing with no contracts.</li>
            <li>&bull; You own your numbers, recordings, and caller data.</li>
            <li>&bull; Honest diagnosis and 72-hour credit policy on our side.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-paper border border-sky-blue">
          <h3 class="font-heading font-bold text-lg text-red-700 mb-3">&times; What We Do Not Do</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate">
            <li>&bull; Never promise revenue or booking quantities.</li>
            <li>&bull; Never charge hidden maintenance, burst, or setup surprises.</li>
            <li>&bull; Never send promotional robocalls or marketing SMS.</li>
            <li>&bull; Never train third-party AI models on your private customer audio.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

  <FinalCta />
</MainLayout>

